        "pseudocode": "Algorithm: ExtractVerifier(a, b)\nInput: Distinct elements a, b \u2208 S\nOutput: Finite-state verifier V distinguishing a from b\n\n1. p \u2190 FindMinimalSeparator(a, b)\n2. V.states \u2190 {0, 1, ..., p-1}\n3. V.transition(q, x) \u2190 x mod p\n4. V.start \u2190 0\n5. V.accept(q) \u2190 (q = a mod p)\n6. Return V\n\nTime: O(|a-b| log |a-b|) for finding p; O(1) per verification\nStates: p (minimal separating prime)"
