        "pseudocode": "Algorithm: ConstructReversible(n)\nInput: Number of states n\nOutput: Reversible trace automaton A\n\n1. A.states \u2190 Z/nZ\n2. A.step(q, a) \u2190 (q + a) mod n\n3. A.rev_step(q, a) \u2190 (q - a) mod n\n4. A.start \u2190 0\n5. Verify: rev_step(step(q, a), a) = q for all q, a\n\nTime: O(1) for construction\nReversibility: Guaranteed by modular arithmetic"
