        "pseudocode": "CONSTRUCT-OBSERVERS(T, available_congruences):\n  F \u2190 empty family\n  unseparated \u2190 {(x,y) : x,y \u2208 T, x \u2260 y}\n  while unseparated \u2260 \u2205:\n    select c from available maximizing |{(x,y) \u2208 unseparated : \u00acc(x,y)}|\n    add c to F\n    remove separated pairs from unseparated\n  return F\n\nComplexity: O(|T|\u00b2 \u00b7 |available| \u00b7 n_selected)\nApproximation: O(log |T|) factor from optimal (set cover reduction)"
